   "date": "2013-02-08T23:41:27Z",
   "subject": "My shiny-server set-up : Shiny-Server no sudo patch",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "I don&#39;t have sudo access on my webservers, so I needed to run as the web user:<div><br></div><div><b><u>The patch</u></b> to allow this in shiny-server can be found here:</div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/alexbbrown/shiny-server/commit/15c54786766b927937d84cea850c87deada53088\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/alexbbrown/shiny-server/commit/15c54786766b927937d84cea850c87deada53088&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409935997000&amp;usg=AOvVaw09h3ZCgVx9khIsr4gZbH6-\">https://github.com/alexbbrown/shiny-server/commit/15c54786766b927937d84cea850c87deada53088</a><br></div><div><br></div><div><u><b>The config:</b></u></div><div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">run_as scbldmnr;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">server {</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  listen 8100;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  location / {</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    log_dir /infrastructure/shiny/log;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    site_dir /infrastructure/shiny/www;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  }</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">}</font></div></div><div><br></div><div><b><u>Running under apache:</u></b></div><div>I then configured apache to proxy a sub-path onto the node.js server:</div><div><br></div><div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">ProxyRequests off</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;Proxy *&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    Order deny,allow</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    Allow from all</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;/Proxy&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;Location /sims/&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    ProxyPass <a href=\"http://localhost:8100/sims/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://localhost:8100/sims/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409935997000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Qe3zs-qjhxMyQusJtFogw\">http://localhost:8100/sims/</a></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    ProxyPassReverse <a href=\"http://localhost:8100/sims/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://localhost:8100/sims/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409935997000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Qe3zs-qjhxMyQusJtFogw\">http://localhost:8100/sims/</a></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;/Location&gt;</font></div></div><div><br></div><div>Hope this helps someone.</div><div><br></div><div>-Alex</div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "YwEiVhW-2rYJ",
   "from": "Joe Cheng",
   "author": "ca443e6eaa0e78ed",
   "date": "2013-02-09T20:46:33Z",
   "subject": "Re: My shiny-server set-up : Shiny-Server no sudo patch",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">This is great. It might make sense to have a run_as value that implies that the current user should be used (and abort with an error if the server is running as root).</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">\r\n\r\nOn Fri, Feb 8, 2013 at 3:41 PM, Alex Brown <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">alexb...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\nI don&#39;t have sudo access on my webservers, so I needed to run as the web user:<div><br></div><div><b><u>The patch</u></b> to allow this in shiny-server can be found here:</div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/alexbbrown/shiny-server/commit/15c54786766b927937d84cea850c87deada53088\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/alexbbrown/shiny-server/commit/15c54786766b927937d84cea850c87deada53088&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409935998000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1GZDeHDCRaLq6jl4sdGfl_\">https://github.com/alexbbrown/shiny-server/commit/15c54786766b927937d84cea850c87deada53088</a><br>\r\n\r\n</div><div><br></div><div><u><b>The config:</b></u></div><div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">run_as scbldmnr;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">server {</font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  listen 8100;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  location / {</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    log_dir /infrastructure/shiny/log;</font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    site_dir /infrastructure/shiny/www;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  }</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">}</font></div></div><div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><b><u>Running under apache:</u></b></div><div>I then configured apache to proxy a sub-path onto the node.js server:</div><div><br></div><div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">ProxyRequests off</font></div><div>\r\n\r\n<font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;Proxy *&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    Order deny,allow</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    Allow from all</font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;/Proxy&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;Location /sims/&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    ProxyPass <a href=\"http://localhost:8100/sims/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://localhost:8100/sims/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409935998000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1WNBbG5gmx1b_9lvKf-zpz\">http://localhost:8100/sims/</a></font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    ProxyPassReverse <a href=\"http://localhost:8100/sims/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://localhost:8100/sims/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409935998000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1WNBbG5gmx1b_9lvKf-zpz\">http://localhost:8100/sims/</a></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;/Location&gt;</font></div>\r\n\r\n</div><div><br></div><div>Hope this helps someone.</div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
